config KILASU
 bool "KilaSU kernel root framework"
 depends on ARM64 || COMPILE_TEST
 depends on SECURITY && SECURITY_SELINUX
 default n
 help
   Default-deny root authorization through /dev/kilasu. Source integration
   and an explicit enforcing SELinux policy are required. See docs/selinux.md.

config KILASU_SELINUX_INTERNAL
 bool "KilaSU built-in SELinux credential adapter"
 depends on KILASU
 default y
 help
   Use the in-tree SELinux credential blob accessor. Never enable for a
   loadable smoke-test module. Missing kilasu policy denies root requests.
